      "side": 1,
      "message": "Perhaps this is best done in subsys/ap_power/signal_vw.c where the ESPI and power handling is common, and allows this issue to be handled in a common place.\nThe init code could be part of power_signal_vw_init(), which we know is called\nas part of the power sequence init.",
      "revId": "0014f515e3c023c5748ff77c87cc86d8c089b047",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5e51b50f_66fa28f2",
